# Backups and merge leftovers. `.env.*` already catches .env.local.bak-*, but a
# backup of a secrets file is the easiest way to leak one into a public repo,
# so catch the general shapes too.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# Credential material that should never be committed
*.pem
*.key
!**/*.key.example

